# 5.4 the camera does not come back within 20 s (09:21): reset-headset once (ordered stop, approved exit bytes),
# the camera is back after 90 s, the session is restored.
start desk
sim reset_back=90
at 10 down usb.cam broker passthrough ctrltrack
expect 29 runs 0
expect 31 ran reset-headset usb.cam
expect 140 ran start monado
expect 170 overall ok
